    <p><strong>Every plan has every feature.</strong> Plans differ by how much of our infrastructure you use, never by which functionality you get. Self-hosting remains free and unlimited.</p>
    <p><strong>Fair use.</strong> Where a plan says unlimited, it means we do not meter it, not that there is no ceiling. The figure in brackets is the point at which we will contact you to agree on a plan that fits. We will always write to you before restricting anything, and we will never delete your data over a quota. If your account moves to a smaller plan, existing projects, documents and collaborators remain available; only creating new ones is paused until you are back within the limit.</p>
    <p><strong>AI operations</strong> are calls to third-party AI providers made on your behalf, such as impact and effort estimation, incident triage, thread drafting and embeddings. You may supply your own AI provider key on any plan, including Free; usage under your own key is not counted here and is billed to you by that provider.</p>
    <p>Limits may evolve. We publish material reductions before they apply to existing active accounts.</p>

