    <p>These terms continue to govern your use of the service itself.</p>
    <p>Prices are in US dollars and exclude taxes, which are added at checkout. Subscriptions renew automatically for the same period until cancelled. You can cancel at any time from your account; access continues until the end of the paid period. Changing to a larger plan takes effect immediately and is charged pro rata; changing to a smaller plan takes effect immediately with the difference credited at your next renewal.</p>
    <p>We may change prices with 30 days' notice by email. A new price applies at your next renewal, never mid-period.</p>

